     },
     {
      "id": "6acf92cbe1f22d7a7d10c407",
      "fieldData": {
       "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Payroll Automation Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is payroll automation?\", \"a\": \"Payroll automation is the use of software to perform the routine payment and compliance tasks of payroll: time tracking, wage calculation, benefits, tax withholding, and direct deposit. The software turns hours and pay rates into paychecks and schedules each deposit for payday.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I set up payroll automation?\", \"a\": \"Describe the work around your pay run in Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a>, one rule per sentence. Say who submits hours and which changes need an approver before the cutoff. Emergent builds the app with its database and dashboard, and connects it to any system you name that offers an API.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a way to automate payroll?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Payroll software calculates wages, withholds federal, state, and local taxes, and schedules direct deposits for payday. The inputs still need people: someone confirms the hours and approves a raise before the run. Those checks and approvals can be automated as well, around the provider you already pay.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should payroll automation software include?\", \"a\": \"It should include connections to the time clock that records hours, the HR system that holds pay rates, and the accounting tool that books each run. Every handoff left manual is a number someone retypes. The same pattern, with inputs checked before a named approver signs off, runs an <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/automated-loan-processing-system'>automated loan processing system</a>, where applications take the place of timesheets.\"}, {\"q\": \"Which payroll decisions should an automated payroll system not automate?\", \"a\": \"Leave the judgment calls to people: whether a 60-hour week happened, whether a raise was promised, and what a final paycheck should include. Write down who decides each one, and give that person a deadline ahead of the cutoff.\"}, {\"q\": \"Which steps of automated payroll processing should I automate first?\", \"a\": \"Start with timesheet approvals and the reminders before the cutoff. They repeat every period and change no pay rate. A mistake there costs a reminder, not a paycheck. Emergent sets no task cap, and a period full of extra shifts runs the same as a quiet one.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I use automated payroll software for contractor invoices?\", \"a\": \"Yes, if your provider pays contractors. ADP's RUN platform, for one, runs payments for W-2 employees and 1099 contractors in the same platform. The contractor's invoice still needs approval before it is paid. That approval step is where <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/invoice'>invoice automation</a> fits: the invoice is read into fields, checked against the agreed rate, and routed to the person who signs off.\"}, {\"q\": \"Do automated payroll services include pay stubs and year-end tax forms?\", \"a\": \"Pay stubs, yes: automated payroll tools keep post-payroll records such as pay stubs and reports. Year-end tax forms depend on the provider, and some go further by generating W-2s or 1099s. Before you sign, ask which forms yours produces and how far back it keeps each record.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should I test before I use an automated payroll service?\", \"a\": \"Run one pay period through both the old process and the new automated payroll service, then compare net pay for every person, line by line. Confirm that year-to-date totals and every deduction carried over. Timesheets and approvals in an app built with Emergent sit in a database you own, and they stay put when the provider changes.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does the payroll automation process include each pay period?\", \"a\": \"Each period, the payroll automation process includes four stages: hours come in from the time clock, managers approve them, payroll reviews anything held, and the provider runs pay after the cutoff. After payday, <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/report'>report automation</a> can send finance a summary of hours and cost by store.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
      }
     },
